<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets $300 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets $300 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST NEW YORK CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    03.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     6.25 BP   PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.794    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.794</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  12.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
